{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kDC8Sg9vq81795649017.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人工智能晶片商輝達，或被國際信貸評級機構標普全球下調信貸評級。</p><p></p><p>標普全球表示，正考慮下調輝達的信貸評級，因為公司的行政總裁黃仁勳離職後再復職，引發對輝達管理及治理的關注。標普可能在90日後，下調輝達目前第三高的「AA」評級，反映公司被列入負面信用觀察名單。標普的聲明稱，預計只會下調一級，除非調查或披露使標普相信，輝達的聲譽或未來業務前景受到損害。</p><p></p><p>此外，穆迪宣布維持輝達評級及前景展望不變。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T00:17:22.643459+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T23:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T05:14:27.490531+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T00:10:47.923888+00:00","content_hash":"2d0f57d87b900d8d50fae511d6a0ad08103113b40b748f7f4d9b039ef1290d2e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T00:17:22.643459+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}